          "benefits_md": "> **Pattern of Assistance:**\n\nTraining, awareness program, extension, technology support.\n&gt; **Type of Assistance:**\n\n\n  - Production and multiplication of good, high-yielding, diseased free planting materials for sale.\n  - Introduction of new high-yielding varieties of mother plants, suitable to the different areas of the State.\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The scheme has been launched for the production and multiplication of good, high-yielding, diseased free planting materials in the Government farms for distribution to farmers through the District Horticulture Officer.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The scheme “Development and Maintenance of Orchard Cum Horti Nurseries” was launched by the Department of Agriculture & Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya for the production and multiplication of good, high-yielding, diseased free planting materials in the Government farms for distribution to farmers through District Horticulture Officer."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme “Development and Maintenance of Orchard Cum Horti Nurseries” was launched by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya for the production and multiplication of good, high-yielding, diseased free planting materials in the Government farms for distribution to farmers through District Horticulture Officer.\n",
